abstract: >-
  An intelligent image enhancement tool inspired by Renaissance techniques.
  Features automatic parameter detection, advanced color preservation, quality
  metrics, parallel batch processing, GPU acceleration (CUDA/OpenCL/Metal),
  REST API with authentication, and distributed processing support. Includes
  comprehensive testing with 463 tests and 80%+ coverage.
